  "id": "taste-bud",
  "term": "taste bud",
  "definition": "A taste bud is a small oval sensory structure in a papilla of the tongue that extends through the full thickness of the epithelium. It contains sensory, supporting, and basal cells, and opens at the surface through a taste pore.",
